<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Resolution 1737, 2007</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;United Nations Security Council Resolution 1737, adopted in December, 2006,&amp;nbsp;charged member nations with working to prevent Iran from developing nuclear weapons.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;This scenario assumes that Iran was not in any way discouraged by this resolution.&amp;nbsp; In fact, it assumes that within weeks of the resolution being passed&amp;nbsp;it was clear that Iran had actually accelerated its efforts to purchase the equipment and materials necessary to develop its own nuclear weapons.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;----------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;For those looking for a little light reading, the&amp;nbsp;full text of U.N. Resolution 1737 may be found here: &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;A href="http://www.un.org/en/ga/search/view_doc.asp?symbol=S/RES/1737%282006%29"&gt;http://www.un.org/en/ga/search/view_doc.asp?symbol=S/RES/1737%282006%29&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
